      <p class="tw-eyebrow">An honest note</p>
      <h2 class="tw-h2">This won’t be twelve weeks of <em>feeling wonderful.</em></h2>
      <p class="tw-p">
        Here’s what no course page usually admits. Sometimes you’ll feel lighter.
        Sometimes you’ll meet something tender first. If all you want is a pleasant
        hour, there are gentler tools that don’t get as real — and they can be good ones.
      </p>
      <p class="tw-p">
        But if you’re willing to meet the parts that have been waiting — the old fear,
        the grief, the anger — what’s on the other side isn’t a quick boost. It’s a
        steadier kind of peace. More lasting. Yours in a deeper way.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
